  "Software Details": "Détails du logiciel",
  "Managing your digital products is easy with the eCommerceGo SaaS Digital Product Module. Whether you are a seasoned entrepreneur or just starting, our platform provides the tools you need to organize, showcase, and deliver your digital offerings efficiently. With our module, you can streamline your entire workflow, from adding products to delivering them to your customers.": "La gestion de vos produits numériques est facile avec le module de produits numériques eCommerceGo SaaS. ",
  "View Live Demo": "Voir la démo en direct",
  "User-Friendly Product Addition Process": "Processus d'ajout de produit convivial",
  "Adding digital products is simple with our intuitive interface. You can easily input all the relevant details for each product, including titles, descriptions, prices, and any additional information you wish to provide. This allows you to create informative product listings that effectively showcase the value of your digital offerings. Plus, our module supports the upload of attachments, like files or images, to complement your products and enhance the customer experience.": "L'ajout de produits numériques est simple grâce à notre interface intuitive. ",
  "Enhanced Frontend Accessibility": "Accessibilité frontale améliorée",
  "Once you have added your digital products, they seamlessly integrate into your storefront. A dedicated column is presented on the front end, giving your customers easy access to all your digital offerings. From here, customers can browse products and download any associated attachments with just a few clicks. This user-friendly interface not only improves the customer experience but also encourages engagement with your digital content.": "Une fois que vous avez ajouté vos produits numériques, ils s’intègrent parfaitement à votre vitrine. ",
  "Robust Backend Management Tools": "Outils de gestion back-end robustes",
  "On the backend, you have full control over your digital products. Our module provides a comprehensive dashboard where you can view, edit, or delete products as needed. This gives you the flexibility to manage your product catalog according to your business requirements. Additionally, you can download attachments directly from the backend, ensuring you always have access to your digital files. With our robust management tools, you can stay organized and efficient in your digital product operations.": "Sur le backend, vous avez un contrôle total sur vos produits numériques. ",
